        "original_id": "b073cdca-26cb-5e9d-8236-3f743f33d703",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Richard Tucholka\n- Products: Fringeworthy, FTL:2448\n- Companies: Tri Tac Games\n- Topics: role-playing games, science fiction\n\nFacts:\n- Richard Tucholka was born on February 9, 1954, and died on April 27, 2017.\n- In 1982, Tri Tac Games first published Fringeworthy as a role-playing game.\n- In 1982, Richard Tucholka created FTL:2448 as a science fiction role-playing game about faster-than-light travel with alien races, and Tri Tac Games published it.\n- Richard Tucholka was a writer, game designer, and publisher best known for his work in creating the role-playing games Fringeworthy and FTL:2448.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
